MagicKey63 Licensing Overview

This repository contains software, hardware design files, and mechanical case
files. Each part is licensed separately:

- Firmware, web UI, and development tools: GPL-2.0-only.
- Hardware electronics design files: CERN-OHL-S-2.0.
- Case and mechanical 3D files: CC-BY-SA-4.0.

Directory level license files define the applicable license for each part:

- firmware/LICENSE
- web/LICENSE
- tool/LICENSE
- hardware/LICENSE
- case_3d/LICENSE

Third party libraries and bundled dependencies keep their own license notices.
If a third party file contains its own license header or license file, that
notice takes precedence for that file.

See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the third party license summary and release
redistribution checklist.

This file is a repository-level summary. Use the directory license files and
the third party notices when redistributing source files, binaries, PCB files,
or mechanical designs.
